  "summary": "node-tough-cookie vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that tough-cookie incorrectly handled cookies when the\nrejectPublicSuffixes option was disabled, leading to prototype pollution.\nAn attacker could possibly use this issue to modify the behavior of\napplications using tough-cookie, resulting in a denial of service, or\nanother unspecified impact.",
